# Upload filter for `gcloud builds submit` (scripts/s5_release_gate.py) and `gcloud deploy releases create`
# (scripts/s6_deploy.py). Starts from the Docker build-context filter and the git ignores, then re-includes what
# the in-cloud unit-tests step and the Cloud Deploy render need. The image itself still honors .dockerignore.
.git
#!include:.dockerignore
#!include:.gitignore
!.gitignore
!.gcloudignore
!tests/
!requirements-dev.txt
!pytest.ini
!cloudbuild.yaml
!clouddeploy.yaml
!skaffold.yaml
!run-service.yaml
!templates/
